{% import "components/lightbox-gallery.njk" as lightboxC %}
<p>Click any photo. Use the arrow keys or the buttons to move between them, and <kbd>Esc</kbd>, the × button, or a click on the dark backdrop to close. The same lightbox is switched on in the {% demoLink "image-gallery", "Image Gallery" %} and {% demoLink "masonry-gallery", "Masonry Gallery" %} demos.</p>
<div class="image-gallery" data-lightbox-gallery>
  {% for item in imageGalleryDemo.items %}
  {{ lightboxC.lightboxItem(item, "image-gallery__item") }}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
<noscript><p>With JavaScript off, each photo is a plain link that opens the full-size image.</p></noscript>
